{
  "source": {
    "from": "Written by hand for Glass Cannon. Which effect and skill IDs go with which mechanic came from GT Companion's dungeon warnings (gaming.tools, 0.5.110) as leads; the wording is ours.",
    "note": "`seen`: the date we confirmed it in our own captures. The rest are unconfirmed leads until a run shows them.",
    "when": "effect: a buff or debuff on the boss (on: boss), on you (you), on another player (ally) or on any player (player). cast: the boss casts one of skills; over when it casts one of until (its own skill: when it goes off). stagger: the boss's stagger check (its gauge turns breakable; over once broken or idle). hit: something on the ground hits you.",
    "times": "max_s: the longest it shows. due_s: when it lands, from its start (a countdown). then: what to do once it's over, for then.s seconds."
  },
